  m_text: '<b>GrubTrail: Highway Run</b>

    Created by Christian Mederos - GPE104, University of Advancing Technology


    <b>Art</b>

    Truck, cars, wrecks: CraftPix - Top-Down Police and Military Car Sprites

    Zombies: CraftPix - Zombie 4 Direction Pixel Character Sprite Pack

    Bullets and effects: CraftPix - Top-Down Tank Game Kit

    Road, grass, finish line, health bar: CraftPix - Rude Races 2D Game Kit

    HUD icons, menu background: CraftPix - Zombie TDS Game User Interface

    Food: OpenGameArt - CC0 Food Icons


    <b>Audio</b>

    Music, engine, crash, zombie death: CraftPix - Free Music and Sounds for Cyberpunk Game Pack 1

    Zombie Shuffle: Mark Edwards, Greenside Productions (Freesound, CC BY 4.0)

    Sound effects: jsfxr (sfxr.me)


    <b>Font</b>

    Zombie by Rotodesign (dafont.com)'
